  "title": "Skinny Pumpkin Spice Muffins with Walnut Streusel",
  "description": "Pumpkin puree, pumpkin pie spice, and cinnamon bake up into tasty muffins in this skinny dessert recipe topped with an oat and walnut streusel.",
  "authors": [
